{"language":"en","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","震岩轮舞"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/en","Twirling Rocks"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","进入“战斗姿态”，拥有更灵活的伤害和逃生手段。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/en","Enters Combat Stance, gaining enhanced flexibility in dealing damage and dodging attacks."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个地图格，蜷缩成球形移动到目标格，对附近1格范围内的敌人造成300% + 20% ATK伤害，随后开启“战斗姿态”，直至战斗结束。“战斗姿态”状态下，可消耗500点能量使用“活跃突进”蜷缩成球撞击目标并回到原本位置，造成260% + 20% ATK伤害并眩晕2秒。另外，当自身受到来自 1 格范围内伤害时，将优先考虑使用“迅疾撤离”蜷缩成球对自身周围1格的敌人造成150% + 5% ATK伤害并降低60%移动速度持续2秒，随后滚动到远离该攻击者的位置，获得最大生命值25%的护盾，持续7秒，该效果至多每7秒生效一次。蜷缩成球期间免疫控制。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Alsa curls into a ball and moves to the target tile, dealing 300% + 20% ATK damage to adjacent enemies, then enters Combat Stance till the end of the battle. In Combat Stance, Alsa consumes 500 Energy to cast Vigorous Slam and hits the targets, then back to the original spot, dealing 260% + 20% ATK damage and stunning them for 2s. Alsa prioritizes casting Swift Evasion to deal 150% + 5% ATK damage to adjacent enemies when taking damage from them, reducing their movement speed by 60% for 2s. Alsa rolls away from attackers afterward, gaining a shield equal to 25% of max HP for 7s. This effect can trigger once every 7s at most. Alsa becomes immune to control effects when curling into a ball."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":37,"end":43,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":117,"end":123,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":189,"end":194,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":65,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":289,"end":295,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":384,"end":389,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":33,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":113,"end":127,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":185,"end":198,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":61,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":285,"end":299,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":380,"end":393,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“活跃突进”造成的伤害提升至270% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt by Vigorous Slam to 270% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":51,"end":57,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":47,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","“活跃突进”造成的伤害提升至280% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt by Vigorous Slam to 280% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":51,"end":57,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":47,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“活跃突进”造成的伤害提升至290% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt by Vigorous Slam to 290% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":51,"end":57,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":47,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","“活跃突进”造成的伤害提升至300% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/en","Increases the damage dealt by Vigorous Slam to 300% + 20% ATK."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":18,"end":24,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":51,"end":57,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":47,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","岩障术"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/en","Stone Barrier"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","对目标造成伤害并召唤岩石柱。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/en","Alsa deals damage to an enemy and creates earth pillars on the field."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","阿尔萨召唤大地之力冲击距离最近的一名敌人，对目标造成270% + 25% ATK伤害并眩晕2 + 0.25秒，在目标身后 3 格生成岩柱，原本处于岩柱位置的敌人将被击退 1 格。场上最多存在6个岩柱。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/en","Alsa channels the power of Earth Force to blast the nearest enemy target, dealing 270% + 25% ATK damage and stunning them for 2 + 0.25s. The blast also creates earth pillars 3 tiles behind this target and knocks back enemies on those tiles by 1 tile. A maximum of 6 pillars can be present on the field. "],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":46,"end":53,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/en",[{"start":86,"end":92,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":127,"en